<div class="page-width page-content">

  <div class="grid">
    <div class="grid__item medium-up--three-quarters medium-up--push-one-eighth">

      <header class="section-header">
        <h1 class="section-header__title">
          {{ page.title }}
        </h1>
      </header>

      {%- if page.content != blank -%}
        <div class="rte rte--nomargin zenkai-policy__intro">
          {{ page.content }}
        </div>
      {%- endif -%}

      <div class="rte rte--nomargin zenkai-policy">
        <p class="zenkai-policy__lede">Please review the policy below before placing your order.</p>

        <h2>All sales are final</h2>
        <p>We do not accept returns or exchanges. This includes change-of-mind purchases, ordering the wrong size or color, and buyer's remorse. Please review product details, measurements, sizing information, and your shipping address carefully before completing checkout.</p>

        <h2>Damaged, defective, incorrect, or missing items</h2>
        <p>If an item arrives damaged or defective, your order contains the wrong item, or an item is missing, email <a href="mailto:admin@zenkaiclothing.com">admin@zenkaiclothing.com</a> within 7 days of delivery. Include your order number, a description of the problem, and clear photos of the item and packaging when applicable.</p>
        <p>Approved claims will be resolved with a replacement at no additional cost. If a replacement is unavailable, we may issue a refund for the affected item. Please do not mail an item back; we cannot accept unauthorized returns.</p>

        <h2>Lost orders</h2>
        <p>If tracking has not updated or your order has not arrived by the end of the estimated delivery window, email us with your order number. We will review the shipment with the carrier and arrange an appropriate replacement or refund when the package is confirmed lost.</p>

        <h2>Order changes and cancellations</h2>
        <p>Orders enter processing quickly. Contact us immediately if you need to request an address change or cancellation. We cannot guarantee changes or cancellations once production or fulfillment has begun.</p>

        <h2>Legal rights</h2>
        <p>This policy does not limit any rights or remedies that cannot be excluded under applicable law. Where the law requires a different remedy, we will follow those requirements.</p>

        <hr>

        <p class="zenkai-policy__why"><strong>Why this policy exists:</strong> our products are prepared specifically for each order, so returned items cannot be restocked or resold.</p>

        <p>Questions before you order? Email <a href="mailto:admin@zenkaiclothing.com">admin@zenkaiclothing.com</a> — we answer every one.</p>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>

</div>

